- ✅ Aider
- ✅ Continue
- ✅ Codex CLI
- ✅ Gemini CLI (no accessible changelog found)

### Key Findings (March 19 - April 11, 2026)

**19 updates identified and documented**, including:

1. **Claude Code** - Computer Use in CLI, interactive lessons, MCP result-size overrides
2. **Cursor** - Background Agents in Slack, BugBot PR review, one-click MCP install, Jupyter support, Memories feature, simplified pricing
3. **GitHub Copilot** - BYOK/local model support, 20% faster validation, usage metrics improvements, SDK public preview
4. **Windsurf** - Adaptive model router, GPT-5.4 mini integration, quota billing
5. **Aider** - Prompt caching, /report command, chat language switch (v0.56.0)
6. **Continue** - Config fixes, workspace filtering (v1.3.38-vscode)
7. **Codex CLI** - Realtime V2 streaming, custom TUI status lines (v0.120.0)

### Community Feedback Collected

Successfully captured user sentiment from:
- **Medium article** analyzing Cursor 3's shift toward agent management
- **Blog post** about Claude Code source leak (with HN discussion references)

### Output File

Results saved to `/home/runner/work/agentdaily/agentdaily/updates/2026-04-13/whitelist-updates.json`

The JSON array is sorted by date (oldest first) and includes all required fields:
- productName, title, description
- updateType (feature/release/announcement)
- url, date
- community_feedback (with source, quote, sentiment)

### Limitations Encountered

- **Rate limiting** on web search API limited ability to gather extensive community feedback from HN/Reddit/X
- **Devin** - No accessible changelog (404 error), only case study content found
